{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for PetChronicle', 'description': 'Primary container for PetChronicle implementation: MyPetStory is a personalized online journal for pet owners to capture, organize, and share every moment of their pet’s life. Users can add memories, photos, and milestones, and generate a printable scrapbook that updates automatically with all their entries. The platform allows sharing the pet’s story via private or public links, creating a lasting digital and physical keepsake.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "PetChronicle-36940 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Add Memory",\n      "description": "Allows users to add memories with text and photos, which are displayed in the timeline and included in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline",\n      "description": "Displays all added memories in chronological order, with an option to add new memories directly from this page.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Photos",\n      "description": "Dedicated page for uploading and viewing all pet photos. Uploaded photos are automatically included in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Milestones",\n      "description": "Users can add and view important milestones in their pet\\u2019s life. All milestones are automatically updated in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Scrapbook",\n      "description": "A printable digital scrapbook that compiles all uploaded photos and milestones, allowing users to add descriptions. Updates automatically with new entries.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Shareable Story",\n      "description": "Users can share their pet\\u2019s story timeline and scrapbook via private or public links with family and friends.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Pet Profile",\n      "description": "Home page allows users to upload their pet\\u2019s image as a profile picture, replacing any default or example content.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#F7C59F",\n    "secondary": "#A3D2CA",\n    "accent": "#5EAAA8"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The home page features a beautiful paw image and allows users to upload their pet\\u2019s profile photo. Navigation includes: Timeline (with add memory option), Photos (for uploading/viewing photos), Milestones (for adding/viewing milestones), and Scrapbook (auto-updated with all photos and milestones, with editable descriptions). The site is clean, modern, and easy to navigate, with a focus on user-generated content and seamless updates across all sections. No example content is shown; all content is user-driven."\n}'}",
